## Catalog gate (Sep) then holdings review (Oct)

```powershell
# ~1 month before: review research vs strategy catalog
invest catalog-gate --open
# Approve any CANDIDATES / review_policy tweaks yourself — nothing auto-merges.

# Prod week: refresh companion holdings (Slack #ledger-holdings), then:
invest research --open
```

