## Pass criteria for the October run

1. Catalog gate for Sep completed (or explicitly deferred with a note)  
2. `invest research` exits 0  
3. Private report lists actions with reasons under the **working / proposal** strategy  
4. Public JSON has no broker names and no `€` amounts  
5. You either execute the approved subset or explicitly defer — no silent skip  
6. Working policy YAML only changes if you agree (catalog gate and/or research change bar)

## Out of scope for October

- Auto-trading / Nordnet API orders  
- Saxo Core ETF sleeve  
- OP ring-fenced ETFs  
- Short-term sleeve (still live-blocked)  
- Auto-editing `CANDIDATES` without human approval  
